<title>USA: Sony, QUALCOMM to make major product announcement.</title>
<headline>Sony, QUALCOMM to make major product announcement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp and QUALCOMM said Friday they will make a major new product announcement regarding CDMA digital handsets on Monday, March 3 in San Francisco.</p>
<p>CDMA is a digital mobile phone technology being used in many of the new PCS systems, said the companies. It is also, they said, being used to upgrade many cellular systems around the country.</p>
<p>Both companies are among the largest involved in  the wireless telecommunications industry.</p>
</text>
